    - target: {fileID: 6437471531436795324, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: Use the button to switch the lamp on and off. Observe what happens to
        the patch of light. Does anything physical get added to or removed from the
        table?T
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 6437471531436795324, guid: 34b3940e982d4fd4b8a073e83a19eed9, type: 3}
